## Main Tables

| Table                    | Description                         |
| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |
| `members`                | Gym members                         |
| `trainers`               | Gym trainers                        |
| `membership_plans`       | Available membership plans          |
| `memberships`            | Member subscriptions                |
| `payments`               | Membership payments                 |
| `classes`                | Gym classes                         |
| `class_schedules`        | Class schedules                     |
| `class_enrollments`      | Member class registrations          |
| `attendance`             | Member attendance records           |
| `exercises`              | Exercise catalog                    |
| `workout_plans`          | Personalized workout plans          |
| `workout_plan_exercises` | Exercises assigned to workout plans |

## Views

* `active_memberships`
* `member_payment_history`
* `class_roster`
* `member_attendance_summary`

